[0.078, "o", "\u001b[0;1;31m Mount point '/boot' which backs the random seed file is world accessible, which is a security hole! \u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0;1;31mRandom seed file '/boot/loader/.#bootctlrandom-seedb5460f8b5990a39b' is world accessible, which is a security hole!\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
